        <mxCell id="refs" value="Waiter, Chef and Cashier are injected. The four-argument constructor creates a default Host; the overload accepts one. Plain associations cover both supported assembly paths. Staff inheritance and independent per-role capacity are shown in the separate staff view. The configured game has one Restaurant, but injection does not forbid reusing a staff instance; the Restaurant end therefore allows 0..*." style="shape=note;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacing=10;fillColor=#fffbe7;fontSize=18;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1">
